# The task skeleton of a convolution, for any kernel. A task between calls
# holds its input pieces, the spare its bands are assembled in and the work of
# the kernel. A call lends the band of its rows, runs the kernel on it and
# returns it: the pieces still hold their cells, the spare keeps room, and the
# kernel's invariant moves from the call's first position past its last.
import Base
